<title>USA: American Eco '96 shr $0.81 vs $0.40.</title>
<headline>American Eco '96 shr $0.81 vs $0.40.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Eco Corp said Tuesday evening that its 1996 earnings were $8.8 million, or $0.81 per share, compared with $0.40 per share for the same twelve month period in 1995.</p>
<p>The company, which provides construction, management, maintenance, and environmental services for various industries, said revenues rose to $120 million in 1996 compared to $46 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The company did not provide fourth quarter results or additional financial information.</p>
